This directory contains source for the Visualize FX graphics kernel module
(hpgfx.o).

This makefile can build the module in both UP and SMP modes without rebooting
the system.  The resulting kernel module is [UP,SMP]/hpgfx.o.
  "make" will build it in both UP and SMP modes.
  "make up"  will only build the UP module.
  "make smp" will only build the SMP module.
  "make install" will build both and install them into
      /lib/modules/<kernelrev>[smp]/video

